# A starling's wingbeat: up, level, down, level. The body never moves; only
# the wings do, which is what makes eight by six read as flight rather than
# as a shape changing. The down stroke holds longest, as it does on a bird.
sprite starling-flight

frame 110ms
art
VV....VV
.VKEXKV.
..KRRK..
..KKKK..
...OO...
........

